---
import pkg from '../../package.json';
---
<p-slide id="misplaced">
  <label for="misplaced-btn">Select a language</label>
  <button
    type="button"
    id="misplaced-btn"
    command="--next"
    commandfor={pkg.name}>Choose&hellip;</button
  >
  <p-fragment index="0" p-effect="move natural" p-duration="2">
    <img src="../img/cursor-windows.svg" class="cursor" p-fragment="0" p-effect="click" p-delay="2" p-duration="2">
  </p-fragment>
  <ul popover p-fragment>
    <li>🇬🇧 English</li>
    <li>🇫🇷 Français</li>
    <li>🇮🇹 Italiano</li>
    <li>🇪🇸 Español</li>
  </ul>
</p-slide>
<style>
  #misplaced,
  #extra-long,
  #fixed-scroll {
    [p-effect="move natural"] {
      position: absolute;
      --from-x: 1em;
      --from-y: 8.5em;

      > img {
        height: 2em;
      }
    }
  }
  #misplaced,
  #extra-long {
    button,
    input {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: inherit;
      border: 0.1em solid #000;
      padding: 0.1em 0.3em;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 0.25em;
      width: 15em;
    }
    button {
      color: gray;
      font-style: italic;
      text-align: start;

      &::after {
        content: "\25BC";
        font-style: normal;
        color: #000;
      }
    }
    ul {
      list-style: "";
      border: 0.1em gray;
      border-style: outset;
      padding: 0 0.5em;
    }
  }
  #misplaced {
    button {
      width: 10em;
    }
    ul {
      width: max-content;
      inset: 8em auto auto 14em;
      margin: 0;
    }
    [p-effect="move natural"] {
      --to-x: 9em;
      --to-y: 2em;
    }
  }
</style>
<p-slide id="extra-long">
  <h4>Intl money transfer</h4>
  <label for="currency-amount">Amount</label>
  <input
    type="number"
    name="currency-amount"
    id="currency-amount"
    value="750"
  />
  <label for="currency-btn">Currency</label>
  <button
    type="button"
    id="currency-btn"
    command="--next"
    commandfor={pkg.name}>Choose&hellip;</button
  >
  <p-fragment index="0" p-effect="move natural" p-duration="2">
    <img src="../img/cursor-windows.svg" class="cursor" p-fragment="0" p-effect="click" p-delay="2" p-duration="2">
  </p-fragment>
  <ul popover p-fragment>
    <li>U.S. dollar (USD)</li>
    <li>Euro (EUR)</li>
    <li>Japanese yen (JPY)</li>
    <li>Pound sterling (GBP)</li>
    <li>Renminbi (CNY)</li>
    <li>Swiss franc (CHF)</li>
    <li>Australian dollar (AUD)</li>
    <li>Canadian dollar (CAD)</li>
    <li>Hong Kong dollar (HKD)</li>
    <li>Singapore dollar (SGD)</li>
  </ul>
</p-slide>
<style>
  #extra-long {
    label {
      margin-top: 0.5em;
    }
    button {
      anchor-name: --currency-btn;
    }
    ul {
      position-anchor: --currency-btn;
      width: 15em;
      inset: anchor(end) auto auto anchor(start);
      background: ivory;
      &::before {
        content: none;
      }
    }
    [p-effect="move natural"] {
      --to-x: 14.1em;
      --to-y: 4.5em;
    }
  }
</style>
<p-slide>
  <div id="fixed-scroll">
    <h4>Ortus et institutio (1841-1865)</h4>
    <h6>Familia medicorum rei publicae faventium</h6>
    <p-fragment index="0" p-effect="move natural" p-duration="2">
      <img src="../img/cursor-windows.svg" class="cursor" p-fragment="1" aria-hidden="false">
    </p-fragment>
    <p-fragment index="0" p-effect="fade" p-delay="2" popover>
      François-Marie Arouet, 1694-1778
    </p-fragment>
    <p>
      Georgius Beniaminus Clemenceau natus est die 28 Septembris 1841 in vico
      Mouilleron-en-Pareds, in domo avorum maternorum, gentis Gautreau, ubi
      mater Emma parere maluerat. Familia Clemenceau ex agrorum dominis et
      medicis regionis quae Bocage vocatur erat: medici in ea gente inde a
      saeculo septimo decimo fuerunt, et proavus, Petrus Paulus Clemenceau,
      exercituum occidentalium medicus tempore rerum novarum, postea in concilio
      legibus ferendis sedit. Duo praedia familia possidebat: Aubraie, villam in
      vico La Réorthe, et Le Colombier, villam rusticam apud Mouchamps, ubi
      Georgius sepultus est. Cum illa Vendea regi et Ecclesiae fidelissima
      esset, familia tamen Clemenceau partes contrarias sequebatur, eorum
      scilicet qui Bleus vocabantur: hi erant cives litteris culti, <a href=""
        >Voltarii</a
      > studiosi, rei publicae dediti.
    </p>
    <p>
      E schola privata Monfort egressus, Georgius lyceum Namnetense
      frequentavit, quod hodie eius nomine appellatur. Discipulus ingeniosus sed
      inconstans, amorem Graeciae antiquae ibi concepit, cuius litteras per
      totam vitam lectitavit; Romam contra aversabatur. Primis studiis anno 1858
      absolutis, die 1 Novembris eiusdem anni scholae medicinae Namnetensi nomen
      dedit, ubi tres annos studuit et probationem eorum quos externos
      (externes) vocant superavit; anno 1861 Lutetiam petivit ut studia
      perficeret.
    </p>
    <p-fragment index="1"></p-fragment>
  </div>
</p-slide>
<style>
  #fixed-scroll {
    padding-inline: 3em;
    font-size: 0.45em;
    overflow: auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1em;

    [p-effect="move natural"] {
      --from-x: -7em;
      --from-y: 7.5em;
      --to-x: 22em;
      --to-y: 17em;
    }
    [p-effect="fade"] {
      position: absolute;
      display: block;
      inset: 27.5em auto auto 26.5em;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 .25em #000);
      --tooltip-bg: ivory;
    }
  }
</style>
<p-slide>
  <ul id="folders">
    <li>
      Documents
      <ul>
        <li>Assessment_final</li>
        <li>Long<p-fragment p-effect="reveal">, very very</p-fragment> long filename</li>
        <li>My passwords</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>Movies</li>
    <li>Pictures</li>
  </ul>
</p-slide>
<style>
  #folders {
    line-height: 1lh;
    padding: 0;
    width: 12em;

    &, ul {
      margin: 0 auto;
      list-style-type: '';
    }
    ul {
      padding-inline: 1em 0;
    }
    li {
      &::before {
        content: '📂';
        display: inline-block;
        width: 1.1em;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        text-indent: 0;
      }
      li::before {
        content: '📄';
      }
    }
    li li {
      position: relative;
      text-indent: -1.1em;
      padding-inline-start: 1.1em;

      &::after {
        content: '';
        border-style: dashed;
        border-width: 0 0 .1em .1em;
        position: absolute;
        inset: auto 100% .5lh auto;
        width: .5em;
        height: 1lh;
      }
    }

    p-fragment {
      white-space: nowrap;
      text-indent: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
<p-slide id="how-arrows">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 200 150">
    <ellipse cx="50" cy="40" rx="40" ry="25" fill="cyan"/>
    <text x="50" y="40">A</text>
    <ellipse cx="150" cy="110" rx="40" ry="25" fill="#faa"/>
    <text x="150" y="110">B</text>
    <path d="M80,60L120,90" stroke-width="2" p-fragment p-effect="drawing" pathLength="100"/>
    <g fill="red" p-fragment p-effect="zoom fade">
      <path d="M99 87a3 3 0 0 1-3-3v-4a3 3 0 0 1 3-3c.603-.006 6-1 6-5 0-2-2-4-5-4-2.441 0-4 2-4 3a3 3 0 1 1-6 0c0-4.878 4.58-9 10-9 8 0 11 5.982 11 11 0 4.145-2.277 7.313-6.413 8.92-.9.351-1.79.587-2.587.747V84a3 3 0 0 1-3 3"/>
      <circle cx="99" cy="92" r="3"/>
    </g>
  </svg>
</p-slide>
<style>
  #how-arrows {
    text {
      font-size: 20px;
    }
    svg :not(text) {
      stroke: black;
    }
    [p-fragment] {
      transform-origin: center;
    }
  }
</style>